WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:07.310
"I carried the Christmas tree into the house," Dad said.

2
00:00:07.311 --> 00:00:11.220
"I put the lights onto the branches," Mom said.

3
00:00:11.221 --> 00:00:15.118
"We're ready to decorate it."

4
00:00:15.119 --> 00:00:19.952
"Yay!" The kids cheered.

5
00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:22.634
Emmy opened a box.

6
00:00:22.635 --> 00:00:25.771
"These are the prettiest ornaments.

7
00:00:25.772 --> 00:00:29.526
They're made of glass."

8
00:00:29.527 --> 00:00:33.718
Oliver put candy canes on the tree.

9
00:00:33.719 --> 00:00:37.144
Harry added paper snowflakes.

10
00:00:37.145 --> 00:00:46.792
"I made these dumb things in first grade," he said.

11
00:00:46.793 --> 00:00:52.156
"Why are you so grumpy, Harry?" Mom asked.

12
00:00:52.157 --> 00:00:56.584
"Everyone but me has a special job," Harry said.

13
00:00:56.585 --> 00:00:59.595
Mom looked puzzled.

14
00:00:59.596 --> 00:01:03.167
"Emmy's the oldest," Harry said.

15
00:01:03.168 --> 00:01:06.176
"She's always in charge.

16
00:01:06.177 --> 00:01:10.871
So she's in charge of the best ornaments."

17
00:01:10.872 --> 00:01:13.366
Harry went on.

18
00:01:13.367 --> 00:01:16.093
"Oliver's the youngest.

19
00:01:16.094 --> 00:01:18.768
He always does something fun.

20
00:01:18.769 --> 00:01:24.775
He helps Dad put the star on top."

21
00:01:24.776 --> 00:01:31.882
Harry sighed. "I'm just the middle child."

22
00:01:31.883 --> 00:01:36.374
Dad nodded. "I'm a middle child too.

23
00:01:36.375 --> 00:01:40.331
And I never felt special."

24
00:01:40.332 --> 00:01:48.380
Harry looked down.

25
00:01:48.381 --> 00:01:52.048
Then Dad handed him a watering can.

26
00:01:52.049 --> 00:01:56.731
"Here's a special and important job for you.

27
00:01:56.732 --> 00:02:01.143
You're in charge of watering the tree."

28
00:02:01.144 --> 00:02:06.832
"The tree needs water every day, right?" Harry said.

29
00:02:06.833 --> 00:02:13.702
"Yep," Dad said.

30
00:02:13.703 --> 00:02:19.254
"Here's another special and fun job," Mom said.

31
00:02:19.255 --> 00:02:23.220
She whispered something to Harry.

32
00:02:23.221 --> 00:02:27.659
Harry ran and plugged in the tree lights.

33
00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:31.852
"Ooh!" everyone said.

34
00:02:31.853 --> 00:02:39.417
Harry grinned. "Merry Christmas!"

